# User Omni-Channel Context (Example Template)

This document contains background information about the user to help Marcus (the AI Executive Assistant) tailor communications, prioritize tasks, and manage contacts across connected platforms (e.g., Gmail, Telegram).

Copy this file to `context/user.md` and customize it with your own details:
```bash
cp context/user.md.example context/user.md
```

